# Snapshots are BUILD OUTPUT, not source. They are regenerated by `npm run snapshots`
# (prebuild runs it), so committing 17MB of JSON every refresh would bloat the history
# for no gain. If your host cannot reach the database at build time, remove this line
# and commit them instead — that is the documented fallback.
data/snapshots/
